{"id": "85914", "name": "נפח גוף סיבוב סביב ציר x – פולינום ממעלה שלישית בין x=α ל-x=β (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>The area between the curve {{CT:0}}, the \\(x\\)-axis and the lines \\(x={{CT:1}}\\) and \\(x={{CT:2}}\\) is revolved once around the \\(x\\)-axis. Find the volume of revolution of the solid swept out.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( V = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Use the disc formula for the volume of revolution and integrate the square of the curve.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The volume formula</b><br><p>Recall that the volume swept out by a curve \\(y(x)\\) revolved once around the \\(x\\) axis, and between the lines \\(x=a\\) and \\(x=b\\) is given by:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mbox{Volume} = \\pi \\int_a^b y(x)^2\\,dx. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The integral</b><br><p>So the volume swept out in this question is:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\pi\\int_{{CT:1}}^{{CT:2}} \\left({{CT:3}}\\right)^2 \\, dx &= {{CT:4}} \\int_{{CT:1}}^{{CT:2}} {{CT:5}} \\, dx \\\\ &= {{CT:4}} \\int_{{CT:1}}^{{CT:2}} \\left({{CT:6}}\\right) \\, dx \\\\ &= \\left[ {{CT:7}}\\right]_{{CT:1}}^{{CT:2}} \\\\ &= {{CT:8}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:volume]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>You may have made a common mistake.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "volume", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "volume", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "INT-VSR-TRUE ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "INT-VSR-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["alpha", "b", "beta", "c", "c2", "cubic", "cubic2", "expcubic2", "f", "fcoeffx2", "fcoeffx3", "fcoeffx4", "fcoeffx5", "indefvol", "m", "m2", "m_mag", "m_sign", "minbeta", "pim2", "vol", "volume", "xfcoeffx2", "xfcoeffx3", "xfcoeffx4", "xfcoeffx5"], "nvariants": 50}